WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,760
Girl, I'm sorry, I scared you

2
00:00:05,270 --> 00:00:08,070
Brother Qin, I'm not afraid of them gossiping

3
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:10,900
I have a clear conscience and so do you

4
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:13,410
They want to report and criticize

5
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:15,010
I'll bear it with you

6
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:19,700
Well, Qin Youlu will not give up.

7
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,140
must be prepared in advance

8
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,200
Qin Youlu took people to find you.

9
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,460
He even took action

10
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:29,470
They can't stop eating

11
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:32,150
Threatening my job and reputation as a judge

12
00:00:33,590 --> 00:00:35,390
That kid Qin Youlu is nothing

13
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,380
You stay away from Lao Qin’s house

14
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:39,300
They are jealous now

15
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:41,060
I definitely want to peel off your skin

16
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:42,900
But you moved your hand

17
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:47,430
He will definitely make trouble for you. Be careful. I understand there is something else.

18
00:00:47,590 --> 00:00:51,680
I want to explain to the team why I cut down the tree.

19
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:53,080
We also dug up killing stones.

20
00:00:54,130 --> 00:00:55,370
These are collective resources

21
00:00:55,810 --> 00:00:57,530
I want to pay for the purchase

22
00:00:57,970 --> 00:00:59,370
To avoid having to implement the facts later
